# a file can be both staged and modified afterwards
I definitions.inc
> init
<<<
+ wug.txt wug.txt
> add wug.txt
<<<
> commit "v1"
<<<
+ wug.txt notwug.txt
> add wug.txt
<<<
+ wug.txt g.txt
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===
wug.txt

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===
wug.txt (modified)

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<
